                        "review": "[b]Absolute trash[/b]\n\n- Playtime: 2 minutes\n\n- Played: 2026\n\n- Context: I was looking for a simple puzzle game.\n\n[b]Review[/b]\n\nIn this no-effort game you have to connect a certain amount of 2+ blocks of the right colour to complete a level. You do this by simply selecting them. I have no idea what you're supposed to get out of this, it's probably the worst puzzle game i've ever played.\n\n[b]1/10[/b]",
